.IX Title "SLMPACK 1"
.TH SLMPACK 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
slmpack \- convert the ARPA format of SunPinyin back\-off language model to its binary representation
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBslmpack\fR \fIarpa_file\fR \fIdict_file\fR \fIbinary_slm_file\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBslmpack\fR converts the ARPA format of a threaded SunPinyin back-off
language model to its binary representation.
.SH "نکته (NOTE)"
.IX Header "NOTE"
If you convert a language model to ARPA format using \fBslminfo\fR, and
then convert it back using \fBslmpack\fR, the check-sum of generated
binary file may be different from that of the original one. The reason
is the padding bits in the n\-gram instances are not initialized before 
writing the data out.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Originally written by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
Currently maintained by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBslminfo\fR(1).
